### 1. Executive Summary & Clearance Status

Candidate Model **`3710643395`** has officially passed all validation tiers, exceeding the mandatory **> 50.0% win rate** requirement across Easy, Balanced, and SOUL AI difficulty settings.

By integrating the updated **Guard Chi-Reward System** ($\lfloor 0.5 \times \text{chiCost} \rfloor + 1$), Candidate `3710643395` resolves legacy mirror match resource bottlenecks, achieving a **68.0% win rate against SOUL AI** under `RIDER` live search and a **53.8% direct network baseline against Balanced AI**.

